<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 18 0 R
/E (We take advantage of the consistency of the playing field: there are always spectral highlights due to bright overhead lights, that always appear on the live victims. Thus, filtering for bright values from the camera quickly identifies live victims. This helps with removing false detections from the custom AI model.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [221]
>>
endobj
